#X obj 673 11 an.tempo~;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 245 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 An audio tempo detector based on the aubio library.
It analyzes the incoming signal and outputs the estimated tempo in
BPM from the first outlet and a detection confidence value from the
second outlet.;
#X text 240 153 The detection is based on onset detection: the object
finds transient events in the signal (attacks \, hits \, note starts)
and estimates the tempo from the intervals between them. The onset
detection function is controlled by @method \, other properties tune
the analysis: @bs and @hs for the analysis window and hop size \, @silence
for the silence threshold \, @threshold for peak-picking and @delay
for compensating a constant system latency.;
